__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# Machine-local agent wiring, none of it shared: `.claude/commands/` holds
# untracked symlinks to the command docs under packages/*/docs/agents/ (see
# issue-loop.command.md), and `.claude/settings.local.json` is per-machine by
# definition. Ignoring the directory covers both; nothing here is meant to be
# committed, so the rule is deliberately broader than the symlinks alone.
.claude/
